578 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The problem is genuinely ambiguous \nUser doesn\047t know exactly what they need\073 dialogue helps clarify \n\nLearning is the goal\054 not just output \nThe dialogue itself is the value \050education\054 coaching\054 tutorials\051 \n\nEmotional context matters \nSupport\054 journaling\054 or coaching where user\047s state is part of it \n\nExtended collaboration is required \nComplex creative projects with iteration over time \n\nHigh stakes require verification \nUser needs to understand and approve AI reasoning before action)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 579 0 R
     /Pg 575 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

579 0 obj
  << /K [ 2 578 0 R ]
     /P 591 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 575 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

580 0 obj
  << /ActualText ( Intent is clear and action is well\055defined \nUser knows what they want\073 just do it \n\nSpeed matters more than explanation \nWaiting for a response feels like friction\054 not dialogue \n\nContext can be inferred \nAI already has what it needs from environment\057history \n\nInteraction is repeated frequently \nNobody wants the same conversation daily \n\nLow stakes allow for undo \nFaster to act and reverse than to discus)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 581 0 R
     /Pg 575 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

